        "ts": "2026-07-20T12:00:00Z",
        "speaker": "提问者",
        "content": "Docker 容器如何设置时区？\n我按官方文档设了 TZ 环境变量但没生效。",
        "type": "text"
      },
      {
        "ts": "2026-07-20T12:00:30Z",
        "speaker": "回答者",
        "content": "除了 TZ 还需要安装 tzdata 包。\nAlpine 镜像用 apk add tzdata。\nDebian 镜像用 apt-get install tzdata。",
        "type": "text"
      },
      {
        "ts": "2026-07-20T12:01:00Z",
        "speaker": "提问者",
        "content": "搞定，谢谢！\n",
        "type": "text"
      }
    ]
